Package: rag-bone-rs
Architecture: amd64
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Local semantic search CLI for docs and multi-language codebases
 rag-bone is a local semantic search command line tool for documentation
 and multi-language codebases. It indexes content into embeddings and
 returns context-aware results without sending data anywhere, suitable
 for private codebases and offline documentation mining.
